# Layout stress plant, piece A (2026-09-24): the boilers and the buffer tank of plant.fluid, the whole
# secondary replaced by one pump and one load. The tank belongs to two cycles (C-129): composed engine
# hard 7 soft 10 by the chain fallback, the tank mirrored; the ladder engine's C18 draws it hard 3.

fluidscript 1
project static plant_big

circuit production 100
fluid water

B1     heat_exchanger power=150 kW out.t=75
B2     heat_exchanger power=150 kW out.t=75
PU_B1  pump
PU_B2  pump
CV_B1  valve kv=16
CV_B2  valve kv=16
T1     tank volume=2000 layers=5 in.level=90% in[2].level=10% out.level=90% out[2].level=10%

connections
T1.out[2] - NB_S
NB_S - PU_B1 - B1 - CV_B1 - NB_M
NB_S - PU_B2 - B2 - CV_B2 - NB_M
NB_M - T1.in

circuit secondary 101
fluid water

PU_S1  pump
LOAD   heat_exchanger power=-250 kW

connections
T1.out - PU_S1 - LOAD - T1.in[2]
